/*---------------------------------------------------------------------------*\
  curate27_vp_glycerol -- the vapour pressure of glycerol, REFITTED to
  measurements (DEV.md 4c C281 step 2).  Written by `bin/choupo-curate vp
  glycerol`; everything above the RESULT paragraph is the DECLARATION, committed
  before any fit ran, so it can be read against the result.

  WHY.  The catalogue record carried `vaporPressure { model AmbroseWalton; }`,
  a corresponding-states ESTIMATE from Tc, Pc and omega that never reads the
  record's own Tb (C279 measured a median 19.6 % AAD over the 25 such records
  with archive data).  Here a three-parameter Antoine is fitted to ONE
  laboratory and held out on ANOTHER that shares no author with it.

  STUDIES (one per article, extracted by `choupo-thermoml extract-vp`; ranked
  by points, ties by DOI):
      10.1016/j.fluid.2015.03.038     113 pts  303.59-436.13 K  Verevkin; Zaitsau; Emel'yanenko; Zhabina
      10.1021/je200766t                11 pts  351.8-462.86 K  Mokbel; Sawaya; Zanota; Naccoul et al.
      10.1016/j.jct.2012.09.032         5 pts  477.25-520.65 K  Veneral; Benazzi; Mazutti; Voll et al.
      10.1021/je800070y                 5 pts  463.15-543.15 K  Yan; Suppes
  SET ASIDE BY NAME:
      10.1016/j.jct.2013.09.046: 4 pressure point(s), fewer than 5
      10.1021/acs.jced.5b01080: 3 pressure point(s), fewer than 5

  PARTITION (the C16 rule, declared): FIT = the study with the most points,
  doi 10.1016/j.fluid.2015.03.038 (113 pts, 303.59-436.13 K); HELD OUT =
  the next largest sharing no author with it, doi 10.1021/je200766t (11 pts,
  351.8-462.86 K).

  BAND: maxAAD 5.0 % (declared before the fit by bin/choupo-curate vp (C281 step 2): the held-out study's own stated relative expanded uncertainty U95(P)/P, AVERAGED over its 11 points (0.707 to 7.38 %, mean 4.98 %), rounded UP to two significant figures -- a mean held against the held-out AAD, which is a mean).

  NORMAL BOILING POINT: the record's Tb 563.15 K lies OUTSIDE the measured span 303.59-462.86 K: the fitted Antoine's own normal boiling point (P = 101.325 kPa) must lie within 2 K of it, or the fit is NOT promoted (an extrapolation that misses the record's own boiling point).

  NO MEASURED POINT IS IN THIS TREE: constant/archiveDatasets declares both
  series by DOI, NIST URL and sha256; `bin/choupo-curate fetch` regenerates
  them into constant/archiveExtracts/ (gitignored).

  RESULT
  @@RESULT-BEGIN@@
  (filled in by bin/choupo-curate after the run)
  @@RESULT-END@@
\*---------------------------------------------------------------------------*/

operations
(
    {
        name       fit_antoine;
        type       vaporPressureFit;
        component  glycerol;

        evidence
        (
            {
                dataset   "constant/archiveExtracts/glycerol-vapourPressure-j.fluid.2015.03.038.dat";
                identity  { doi "10.1016/j.fluid.2015.03.038"; }
                role      fit;
            }
            {
                dataset   "constant/archiveExtracts/glycerol-vapourPressure-je200766t.dat";
                identity  { doi "10.1021/je200766t"; }
                role      validation;
            }
        );

        acceptance
        {
            maxAAD  5.0 percent;
            origin  "declared before the fit by bin/choupo-curate vp (C281 step 2): the held-out study's own stated relative expanded uncertainty U95(P)/P, AVERAGED over its 11 points (0.707 to 7.38 %, mean 4.98 %), rounded UP to two significant figures -- a mean held against the held-out AAD, which is a mean";
        }

        output     { file fit_antoine.csv; }
    }
);
